== Acquisition ==
Issued on August 8, 2024, to [[Helldiver]]s whose accounts existed prior to that date.<ref>Discord conversation with AH Support regarding exclusive item eligibility brackets | [https://discord.com/channels/1210060956584124416/1210073264928456764/1496914142777311253 Discord link] | [[:File:Primary_Source_Discord_conversation_with_BVits_regarding_exclusive_item_eligibility_brackets.png|File]]</ref> Viewers of the [https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/553850/view/4339865428685122196 Escalation of Freedom livestream event] received two days early access to this set.<ref>{{cite discord|url=https://discord.com/channels/1102970375731691612/1102974129734434919/1270006727856881665|author=baskinator|message=Join us and PlayStation Access for a sneak peek of Escalation of Freedom on Steam. Watch our devs answer questions and get 48 hours early access to the new armor set "TR-40 Golden Eagle".|channel=hd2-announcements}}</ref>

